WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.062
In under two minutes, you will review the homes your neighbors entered.

00:00:04.062 --> 00:00:05.079
We start on the map.

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:09.312
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.095 --> 00:00:13.517
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:13.517 --> 00:00:16.007
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:16.007 --> 00:00:17.353
Tap Use my location.

00:00:19.087 --> 00:00:21.303
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:21.303 --> 00:00:21.955
Tap Allow.

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:27.966
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:27.966 --> 00:00:29.183
See the three dots?

00:00:29.183 --> 00:00:29.731
Tap them.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.302
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:34.999 --> 00:00:35.628
Tap Mine.

00:00:35.628 --> 00:00:37.577
These are the contests you run.

00:00:39.254 --> 00:00:41.277
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:00:41.277 --> 00:00:42.645
This is your dashboard.

00:00:44.532 --> 00:00:45.318
Tap Entries.

00:00:45.318 --> 00:00:48.038
Nothing goes on the map until you approve it.

00:00:49.844 --> 00:00:52.874
Tap Approve to put a home in the contest, and on the map.

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:56.914
Tap Decline if an entry does not fit.

00:00:58.646 --> 00:00:59.844
A window asks why.

00:00:59.844 --> 00:01:03.502
The reason is optional, and it is emailed to the entrant.

00:01:03.502 --> 00:01:04.637
Tap Decline entry.

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:08.251
Changed your mind?

00:01:08.251 --> 00:01:09.791
Tap Restore to put it back.

00:01:11.672 --> 00:01:14.992
Next up: Edit your contest and change the dates.
